# French for Last One Dry.
#
# The msgid is the English text as the code and the scenes write it (Language): keep
# every %s, %d and %.1f of it, in the same order. A msgctxt tells two uses of one
# English text apart: "pad" a pad's button, "key" a key's name, "the" a noun with its
# article, as "grab the %s" takes it.
